oes in\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/README.md:88:  `codex` -- codex has no canned-response mechanism of its own, so this\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/README.md:101:this adapter re-invokes `codex exec` once more (the same reinstruction\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/README.md:102:text appended to the instruction) before ever reporting a halt. A second\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/README.md:110:## No subagent concept to guard (issue #88)\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/codex/README.md:118:did. `conformance.json` declares `\"subagent_guard\": {\"supported\":\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/templates/workflows/attavo-spec-gate.yml:63:# The counsel step runs only when the gate itself ran and refused --\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/templates/workflows/attavo-spec-gate.yml:65:# step already keys on -- so a passing gate never gets a counsel record\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/templates/workflows/attavo-spec-gate.yml:66:# (issue #133: a counsel record on a passing gate would be noise, and a\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/templates/workflows/attavo-spec-gate.yml:67:# step without this guard would produce one on every PR). It runs before\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/templates/workflows/attavo-spec-gate.yml:69:# so counsel-NN.json rides into the same commit as the spec-NN.json\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/templates/workflows/attavo-spec-gate.yml:71:# configured -- an unconfigured [executor].counsel fails this step the\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/templates/workflows/attavo-spec-gate.yml:122:      - name: attavo counsel\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/templates/workflows/attavo-spec-gate.yml:123:        id: counsel\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/templates/workflows/attavo-spec-gate.yml:125:        run: attavo counsel\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/adapters/fixture/run:32:if [ \"${ATTAVO_STAGE:-build}\" = \"counsel\" ]; then\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/att